## Dependencies
```r
library(pharmaverseadam)
library(gtsummary)
library(ggplot2)
library(gt)
library(binom)
library(dplyr)
```

## Key Statistical Methods
- **Frequencies & Percentages:** Based on number of unique subjects with each AE
- **95% Confidence Intervals:** Clopper-Pearson exact method (appropriate for small sample proportions)
- **Treatment Emergent:** Defined as TRTEMFL = "Y"
